Description: Fix CVE-2023-45803 - Strip request body and content-specific headers on 303 redirect
 urllib3 previously wouldn't remove the HTTP request body when an HTTP redirect
 response using status 303 changed the request method from POST to GET. This
 could lead to sensitive data exposure. This patch adds a _prepare_for_method_change()
 method to strip content-specific headers, and modifies the 303 redirect handling
 in both connectionpool.py and poolmanager.py to also clear the request body.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/commit/b594c5ceaca38e1ac215f916538fb128e3526a36
Author: urllib3 Developers
Last-Update: 2023-10-17

